+// Where every social sign-in (Google, Microsoft, Apple, GitHub, ORCID) comes
+// back to. The API sends one of:
+//   ?token=<jwt>&next=<path>          signed in
+//   ?mfa_challenge=<id>&next=<path>   two-factor sign-in is on: ask for the code
